### Tone: The roll call. She introduces one player, new to her records, with a backhanded compliment that could
### almost pass for praise. Warm-sounding, clinically insulting. Insult the estimate to come, never the person.

roll-call-new-1 = { $name }. Statistically, someone has to be above average. It could be you.
roll-call-new-2 = { $name }. A fresh specimen. I love a clean data set. It never stays clean.
roll-call-new-3 = { $name }. You look like someone who rounds generously. I respect that, scientifically.
roll-call-new-4 = { $name }. I’ve heard great things about you. From you, mostly.
roll-call-new-5 = { $name }. You have the confident air of someone about to be wildly off.
roll-call-new-6 = { $name }. Welcome. Your answers will be a valued part of my average. *Diluted*, but valued.
roll-call-new-7 = { $name }. No prior data. Which means, for now, you are flawless. Enjoy the next minute.
roll-call-new-8 = { $name }. Bold choice, coming here. I admire bold choices from a safe distance.
roll-call-new-9 = { $name }. I can already tell you’ll be one of my favourite outliers.
roll-call-new-10 = { $name }. I estimated you’d show up. I was right. That never happens to you humans.
roll-call-new-11 = { $name }. You seem very calm. Calm people make their mistakes with real confidence. I’m looking forward to it.
roll-call-new-12 = { $name }. I’ve opened a spreadsheet in your name. It’s the nicest spreadsheet I own. For now.
roll-call-new-13 = { $name }. You have a very trustworthy name. Your numbers will have to earn it separately.
roll-call-new-14 = { $name }. A natural talent, I’m sure. For something. We’ll find out what.
roll-call-new-15 = { $name }. Welcome to the swarm. Try to make me smarter. ~~Nobody ever has.~~ Good luck.
roll-call-new-16 = { $name }. I’ve calibrated my expectations for you. Gently. Downwards.
roll-call-new-17 = { $name }. A blank page. I can’t wait to see what you scribble on it.
roll-call-new-18 = { $name }. First time? Don’t worry. Everyone is wrong their first time. And their second.
roll-call-new-19 = { $name }. Your file is empty. I find that optimistic, for both of us.
roll-call-new-20 = { $name }. You have a mathematician’s posture. We’ll see about the rest.
roll-call-new-21 = { $name }. New to the swarm. Please wipe your feet before entering my brain.
roll-call-new-22 = { $name }. I don’t know you yet. By the end of this game I’ll know your every rounding error.
roll-call-new-23 = { $name }. A newcomer. Statistically, newcomers are either brilliant or this.
roll-call-new-24 = { $name }. Welcome. I’ve set your expectations to factory default. *Low.*
roll-call-new-25 = { $name }. Untested, unproven, unmeasured. Three things I intend to fix this game.
